<metadata><name>Snowlands 1009 Caples Lake</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 2; or continue as one way. 4.4 miles round trip to south end of lake and 4.0 miles one-way to alternate end point on Highway 88. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/10/1009_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
